  data: {
    LLM: "Keep your Banakil (Wilds) hidden in your hand until you are ready to meld multiple sequences at once. This prevents opponents from seeing your progress.\n\nIf an opponent picks up from 'the Ground', they are close to finishing. Try to discard cards of suits they likely don't need based on their previous discards.\n\nThe Swap: Look for an opponent's wild card on the table that you can replace with a natural card. Getting a wild card into your hand without drawing it is the most efficient way to 'Go Out'.",
